reboot - restart the computer

SYNOPSIS
    reboot

DESCRIPTION
    Drain filesystem operations and restart the computer. The
    command requires root privilege. If a volume cannot be
    synchronized, reboot leaves the system running and reports an
    error. Close open unlinked files before trying again.

SEE ALSO
    poweroff(1)
